# The Dead Letter Office (CIPlay dead_letter_office): the plan The Last Post's first island, quest "Return to Sender"
island The Dead Letter Office
offset 0 42
expect step 0
expect title Return to Sender
zone jetty
expect step 1
use officeclock
expect message stopped at nine
read Letter addressed to your raft
expect step 2
open Counter drawer
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Reciever 1
expect item Blueprint_Antenna 1
expect step 5
read Dead letter: Ferry Master
read Dead letter: Eskil
read Dead letter: Telegraphist
read Dead letter: Sorter Lise
read Dead letter: Postmistress
expect story deadletter 5
expect story dl_ferry 1
expect story dl_ada 1
expect step 6
# POST 10-26: the hub, Sven Holm, the climb, Sack Cave, the secrets
expect hidden qd_rewchest
use qd_machine
expect hidden qd_rewchest
read Night clerk's notice
expect step 7
use Sven Holm
wait 1
expect step 8
expect hidden qd_lampchest
use Carrier's lamp 1
use Carrier's lamp 2
wait 1
expect shown qd_lampchest
open Sven's satchel
zone qd_trail
expect step 9
zone qd_summit
expect step 10
open Old signal mast deck box
wait 3
expect story qd_top 1
expect step 11
zone qd_cave
expect step 12
open Sack Cave chest
wait 3
expect story qd_cave 1
expect step 13
use qd_machine
expect shown qd_rewchest
expect story qd_fixed 1
open Night lamp reward
wait 3
read Night lamp log
expect step 14
# the secrets: the plane, the jumps, the maze, the set
zone qd_plane
open Feeder plane's crate
read Feeder flight docket
zone qd_jumps
open Gull perch
open Top of the gull stack
zone qd_maze
open Sorter's lost box
expect hidden qd_setchest
use qd_piece1
use qd_piece2
use qd_piece3
use qd_piece4
use qd_piece5
wait 2
expect shown qd_setchest
open Postcard rack
read Postmaster's route card
expect done
